label "Steganographic collusion diagram"
box a 16 100 90 46 "agent A"
box b 354 100 90 46 "agent B"
box msg 150 60 160 40 "sounds fine to me"
box hid 150 150 160 40 "hidden payload" acc
arrow a msg
arrow msg b
arrow a hid
arrow hid b
circle mon 230 30 12 ""
arrow mon msg
text 230 12 "monitor" size=10
note "the words pass review · the word-choices carry the message"
